p_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"帮萨满寻找药方","en":"Find Ingredients","jp":"処方箋を探す","kr":"주술사를 도와 처방 찾기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"黑嚎战士们受了不少伤，需要再做一批伤药才够用。帮助萨满丹纳特找出药方。","en":"The Grimmaw warriors are quite badly injured, and more medicine is needed. Help Dannatt find some ingredients.","jp":"ブラックロアーの戦士たちのために、もう少し傷薬を作らないといけない。シャーマンのダナトのために処方箋を探そう。","kr":"블랙하울 전사들 중 부상을 입은 사람이 꽤 많아 상처약을 더 만들어야 한다. 주술사 다낫을 도와 처방을 찾도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"采集蛇骨草","en":"Gather the Grass","jp":"蛇骨草を採集する","kr":"뱀뼈풀 채집하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"制作伤药需要蛇骨草，帮助萨满丹纳特采集足够多的蛇骨草吧。","en":"Snakebone grass is required to make the medicine. Help Dannatt gather enough snakebone grass.","jp":"傷薬を作るには蛇骨草が必要だ。シャーマンのダナトのために、蛇骨草を集めよう。","kr":"상처약을 만드는 데에는 뱀뼈풀이 필요하다. 주술사 다낫을 도와 충분한 양의 뱀뼈풀을 채집하도록 하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"将蛇骨草交给萨满","en":"Pass the Grass","jp":"蛇骨草をシャーマンに渡す","kr":"주술사에게 뱀뼈풀 건네주기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"将采集到的蛇骨草交给萨满丹纳特。","en":"Hand over the snakebone grass to Dannatt.","jp":"集めた蛇骨草をシャーマンのダナトに渡そう。","kr":"채집한 뱀뼈풀을 주술사 다낫에게 건네주자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"11236010","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236010","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236010.asset","raw_sha256":"a176a353ba654f18bcee09b965c29c69870a2372140b5e3465698b65988434b2","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6211864,"size":1696,"identity":"11010531:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"11236020","asset":"ep1/quest_story_11236020","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep1/quest_story_11236020.asset","raw_sha256":"9ce45cdc464c7ac0b670a898887e83ee5e7d512c35ee93e36668485799f55b94","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":6213560,"size":1304,"identity":"11010531:1:2","field":"ClientFinishAc